    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それはもう、ピンチをチャンスにするぞーってカンジで\r\n演技とパフォーマンスで黙らせるぞ！　って決まってんの",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう……\r\nそうなのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060220,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うん、冬優子ちゃんともそう話したから\r\n心配しなくてオッケー♪",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それならよかった\r\n愛依、ずっと元気ないような気がしてたからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060230,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060240,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ～……実はさ～\r\n弟と、喧嘩しちゃったんだよね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……珍しいな\r\n仲がいいのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060250,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "色んなとこ遊びに行こうって\r\n約束しててさ～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、急に仕事入ったからだよな\r\n弟さんにも、申し訳ないことしちゃったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060260,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いやいや！　やるって決めたのはうちだし！\r\nプロデューサーは悪くないっしょ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060260"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060270,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だから、弟にごめんって思う分\r\n頑張んなきゃ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00479",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060280,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\nうち、この役やれてよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060280"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060290,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "冬優子ちゃんみたいにばっちり完璧に\r\n演じ切れるかっていったらヤバそうだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060290"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060300,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あさひちゃんみたいに完コピとかも無理かもしんないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00329",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060310,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だけど改めて台本読んでてさ\r\nこの役やっぱ、うちっぽいじゃん？　ちょっと",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060310"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060320,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "だから、わかる気がすんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060330,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "可愛いって思うもの付けてさ、\r\nメイクして、ネイルして、髪とか巻いて気合い入れて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060330"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060340,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そしたらちょっと、強くなった気がすんの\r\nすごいわかる気がするし",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060340"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060350,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……だから、この役はうちが\r\n一番上手くやれる気がする",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん\r\n愛依なら大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00413",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060360,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ね、プロデューサーはさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060360"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060370,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "もしうちが最初に、ああいうキャラに\r\nなってなかったら……って、思ったことある？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060370"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00329",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そう聞くってことは\r\n愛依はそう思ってるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060380,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "思ったことはあるよ\r\nうちが緊張しなければ、みんなに迷惑かけなかったなって",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060380"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060390,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "けど、今は思ってない\r\nていうか、それがあったから今のうちがいるし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060390"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060400,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "決めたからには、今は\r\nストレイライトの和泉愛依として",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060400"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060410,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あたしらしく頑張ろうって思ってる",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060410"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺も、もしかしたら俺のプロデュースのせいで\r\n愛依に大変な思いをさせてしまってるんじゃないかって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう思ったことはたくさんあるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060420,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060420"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、愛依をスカウトして……\r\nストレイライトになってもらったことを後悔したことはない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一度も",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060430,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
