  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060460,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060460"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、起き上がらなくてもいいよ\r\n休憩中だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060470,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "休憩じゃないっす！\r\n考え中っす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060470"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、そうか……\r\nすまんすまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、何を考えてたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060480,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ライブパートのダンスっすよ\r\n全然上手くいかないっす",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105006/4001050060480"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、制作のスタッフさんたちからは\r\nかなりいい感じに仕上がってるって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001050060490,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "みんなそう言うっすけど……\r\nでも、違うんすよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
